# Organization context (copy and customize)

1. Copy this file to `ORG-CONTEXT.md` in the same folder.
2. Replace every `{{PLACEHOLDER}}` with your environment.
3. The skill reads `ORG-CONTEXT.md` when giving install or deployment advice.

Do not commit `ORG-CONTEXT.md` if it contains internal paths or hostnames.

